<p> </p>
<p><b>Summary</b></p>
<p>Tea drinking has many health benefits.  Some consider tea to be the sometimes forgotten super food.  Nearly every aspect of your health and appearance is positively impacted by the healing and rejuvenating powers of tea.  It complements your meals, hydrates your body, and relaxes you while keeping your brain sharp and your body strong.  If you have not committed to tea drinking, we suggest giving it a try.  At<a href="/"><span> BeauTeas</span></a>, we want to help you find your beauty good health.  Join us now on the path to finding your best self, from the inside out.  </p>
<p> </p>
<p> </p>', 5,
   (SELECT id FROM blog_categories WHERE slug='learn'), '7 Of Tea''s Health Benefits for Women', 'If you think it can''t get much better than cozying up in your favorite chair with a hot cup of tea, you are WRONG! Because  there is something even better than that!  It''s knowing that that warm cup of tea in that soft easy chair is making you better!  Younger, sharper, healthier, and maybe even thi',
   CAST(strftime('%s', '2021-07-19') AS INTEGER), unixepoch(), unixepoch(), 'shopify-migration');

