VALUES ('Love the Planet Love Yourself', 'love-the-planet-love-yourself', '2022-02-09', 'BeauTeas Team', 'Organic, Clean Beauty, and Plant Based/Whole Foods, aren’t just buzzwords. They mean better products for you and the world around you. Learn about our eco-friendly products!', '[]', 'https://img.beauteas.com/blog/jaromir-kavan-i9eaAR4dWi8-unsplash.jpg', 'Love the Planet Love Yourself',
   'published', '<h3>Love the Planet, Love Yourself!</h3>
<p>The BeauTeas team lives in beautiful Colorado. Our teas are blended and packaged, and shipped from Colorado. We love the outdoors, the mountains, the prairie, hiking, snowboarding, horseback riding, and appreciating the amazing things that nature has to offer.&nbsp;</p>
<p>We make our products as eco friendly as possible.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>
<ul><li>The boxes are made from paper and are easily recycled.&nbsp;&nbsp;</li>
<li>The tea itself is all 100% certified USDA organic. Fully biodegradable and compostable.&nbsp;&nbsp;</li>
<li>The tea bags are made from 100% non-GMO sugar cane. Fully biodegradable and compostable.</li>
<li>The only plastic is the bag around the tea bags, which is required for food safety and freshness. It is also recyclable.&nbsp;</li>
<li>All shipping and packing materials are 100% recyclable.</li>
</ul>
<p>Organic, Clean Beauty, and Plant Based/Whole Foods, aren’t just buzzwords. They mean better products for you and the world around you.</p>
<p>So sip, and enjoy, knowing that in addition to be great for your body, BeauTeas is also easy on the planet!</p>
<img src="https://img.beauteas.com/blog/organic4colorsealgif-1643919355135.gif" alt="" />
<h4>USDA Certified Organic</h4>
<img src="https://img.beauteas.com/blog/wfpb_certifed_600px-1643919387189.png" alt="" />
<h4>Plant Based - Whole Food</h4>
<img src="https://img.beauteas.com/blog/moneyback-1638227647555.png" alt="" />
<h4>30 Days, 100% Guarantee</h4>', 1,
   (SELECT id FROM blog_categories WHERE slug='learn'), 'Love the Planet Love Yourself', 'Organic, Clean Beauty, and Plant Based/Whole Foods, aren’t just buzzwords. They mean better products for you and the world around you. Learn about our eco-friendly products!',
   CAST(strftime('%s', '2022-02-09') AS INTEGER), unixepoch(), unixepoch(), 'shopify-migration');

