VALUES ('Delicious snacks to have with your tea', 'delicious-snacks-to-have-with-your-tea', '2022-02-21', 'BeauTeas Team', 'If you are working hard to look and feel your best, you should consider drinking more tea. Learn about some delicious snacks to have with a nice cup of tea.', '[]', 'https://img.beauteas.com/blog/pexels-maria-tyutina-814264.jpg', 'Delicious snacks to have with your tea',
   'published', '<h3>Delicious Snacks To Have With Your Tea</h3>
<img src="https://img.beauteas.com/blog/pexelsmariatyutina814264-1645493311013.jpg" alt="" />
<p>If you are working hard to look and feel your best, you should consider adding ‘drinking tea’ to your list of good habits. Did you know that our tea can help you have clearer, healthier skin, and has many other benefits for your body and mind?</p>
<p>If you want to start drinking more tea, then you may also want to enjoy some healthy snacks with it. Also, if you’re wondering how to kick the afternoon slump into more productivity, then having some tea, and a snack to go with it, may be exactly what you’re looking for. Learn what delicious snacks to have with your tea so you can have an enjoyable afternoon and a nice little pick-me-up.</p>
<h3>Scones</h3>
<p>You should always start your day with a good breakfast. For a great beginning, you may want to consider having a scone with our <a href="/products/clearly-calendula-morning">Clearly Calendula Morning black tea</a>. It’s a tasty combination and you’ll feel satisfied and more energized going into the day. If you’re looking for a new and healthy scone recipe to try, take a moment to see how to make <a href="https://www.ambitiouskitchen.com/healthy-blueberry-greek-yogurt-scones/">Healthy Blueberry Greek Yogurt Scones</a>. Additional morning snacks and foods to try before you head to work, or go out on an adventure, are blueberries, avocados, and flax seeds. Pair these concentration boosting brain foods with our morning skincare tea and you’ll be on your way to feeling wonderful and looking your best!</p>
<h3>English Tea Style Snacks</h3>
<p>In the afternoon, you’ll want to avoid feeling sluggish. One way to combat this common daily decline, and ensure you have an energy boost and a smile on your face is to have some caffeinated tea and an afternoon snack. There are many different English Style tea snacks you can pair with our Clearly Calendula Afternoon tea. For example, cucumber sandwiches are not only easy to make and whip up but are also very appetizing. An English Tea Cucumber Sandwich will be the perfect choice to have with your cup of tea. Additional recipes and ideas to try include:</p>
<ul><li><a href="https://sallysbakingaddiction.com/mini-quiche-recipe/">Mini-Quiches</a></li>
<li><a href="https://www.ohhowcivilized.com/easy-ham-and-cheese-tea-sandwiches/">Easy Ham &amp; Cheese Tea Sandwiches</a></li>
<li><a href="https://insanelygoodrecipes.com/blackberry-jam/">Blackberry Jam</a></li>
<li><a href="https://www.crazyforcrust.com/fruit-tarts/">Fruit Tarts</a></li>
<li><a href="https://www.food.com/recipe/english-shortbread-97832">English Shortbread</a></li>
<li><a href="https://www.spendwithpennies.com/classic-deviled-eggs-recipe/">Classic Deviled Eggs</a></li>
</ul>
<p>These are just some of the options and recipes to choose from. There are many more possibilities to discover, depending on what you’re in the mood for, and what type of snacks you like to go with your afternoon tea.</p>
<h3>Dark Chocolate</h3>
<p>Dark chocolate is a great snack to have with your tea because it contains less sugar and more antioxidants than the lighter varieties. It’s the right combination for increasing your awareness, lowering blood pressure and helping you to focus better throughout your day. When you consume tea and dark chocolate you can avoid the post-lunch slump and get refocused and re-energized. There is no right or wrong when it comes to the type of dark chocolate to pair with your tea. It’s best to experiment and try <a href="/product/clearly-calendula-sample-pack">different combinations of tea and dark chocolate</a> together until you find one that you believe is the most appealing.</p>
<p>If you want to optimize antioxidant intake and improve focus and concentration, then you should pair our green or black teas with some dark chocolate. It’s a lovely combination, and will satisfy your sweet tooth as well. There’s <a href="https://www.bizjournals.com/triangle/news/2020/12/01/covid-diet-fight-virus-chocolate-green-tea-grapes.html">some research that seems to show that green tea and dark chocolate may help prevent the Covid-19 infection</a>. According to the study, they found that chemical compounds from green tea and dark chocolate were able to bind to different portions of the main protease and might work to block the infection to some extent. This is a finding that some researchers believe could be a big deal. Essentially, certain foods (like dark chocolate) and drinks (such as green tea) have chemical compounds that can block the function of a key enzyme in Covid-19.</p>
<h3>Bedtime Snacks</h3>
<p>You might be stressed out and wound up from your day and want a healthy way to relax and unwind. In this case, you can choose to enjoy our herbal <a href="/products/clearly-calendula-evening">Evening tea</a>, and a bedtime snack. Your favorite bedtime snack might vary from day to day. If you’re looking for a healthy and nutritious option that might help to prevent blood sugar spikes, you might want to consider eating foods like apple slices, bananas, peanut butter, and nuts. On the other hand, if you are craving a more decadent option, then a warm chocolate chip cookie might be most suitable for you in the evening hours. Either option pairs wonderfully with our <a href="/products/clearly-calendula-evening">caffeine free Evening tea</a>. Drinking our tea before bed will calm you down, help you sleep, and revitalize your skin.</p>
<h3>Benefits of Drinking Tea</h3>
<p>There are many benefits of drinking tea and you might enjoy the experience and taste more when you pair it with a tasty snack. Teas contain antioxidants which are good for your skin and body. Tea has less caffeine than coffee, and may help with weight loss, and reduce your risk of a heart attack or stroke. Most importantly, you can reduce stress, improve sleep and relaxation, and ensure your skin appears smooth and flawless. We encourage you to <a href="/collections/best-selling-products">shop all our products and teas </a>if you’re interested in picking up the habit and seeing what drinking tea regularly can do for you.</p>
<h3>Why We Do What We Do</h3>
<p>We want you to feel beautiful, confident, and be healthy. Therefore, we work hard to provide you with the tea products that will help you achieve this goal. All of our teas are certified Organic by the USDA. BeauTeas was created by blending a love of the beauty community with a love for nourishing the body (and soul) with all-natural organic plant-based goodness. We believe that the best way to improve how your body looks and feels is through clean plant-based nutrition. By blending organic flowers and powerful, healing herbs to make tasty hydrating teas, our products make it easy for anyone to improve their skin and appearance without slathering on harsh chemicals. Our company is based on the idea that we believe everyone will enjoy our teas and will benefit from our amazing blends regardless of age or gender.</p>', 5,
   (SELECT id FROM blog_categories WHERE slug='learn'), 'Delicious snacks to have with your tea', 'If you are working hard to look and feel your best, you should consider drinking more tea. Learn about some delicious snacks to have with a nice cup of tea.',
   CAST(strftime('%s', '2022-02-21') AS INTEGER), unixepoch(), unixepoch(), 'shopify-migration');

