VALUES ('Top 10 Most Important Ways to Take Care of Your Skin', 'top-10-most-important-ways-to-take-care-of-your-skin', '2023-01-29', 'BeauTeas Team', 'Having healthy and radiant skin requires proper care and attention. However, with so many products and routines on the market, it can be overwhelming to know where to start. In this article, we will focus on the top 10 most important ways to take care of your skin with a focus on hydration and organic methods.', '[]', 'https://img.beauteas.com/blog/pexels-shiny-diamond-3762562-2.jpg', 'Top 10 Most Important Ways to Take Care of Your Skin',
   'published', '<p>Having healthy and radiant skin requires proper care and attention. However, with so many products and routines on the market, it can be overwhelming to know where to start. In this article, we will focus on the top 10 most important ways to take care of your skin with a focus on hydration and organic methods.</p>
<ol>
<li>
<p>Drink Plenty of Water: Hydration is crucial for maintaining healthy skin. Aim to drink at least eight glasses of water per day to keep your skin hydrated and glowing.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>Use a Gentle Cleanser: Use a gentle, organic cleanser to remove dirt and impurities from your skin. Avoid using harsh soaps and alcohol-based products that can strip your skin of its natural oils.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>Exfoliate Regularly: Regular exfoliation helps to remove dead skin cells, leaving your skin looking smoother and brighter. Use an organic scrub or brush to gently exfoliate your skin once a week.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>Apply Moisturizer: Use a rich, organic moisturizer to hydrate your skin and lock in moisture. Look for products that contain ingredients like shea butter, almond oil, and jojoba oil, which can help to soothe and nourish your skin.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>Protect Your Skin from the Sun: Protect your skin from harmful UV rays by applying an organic, broad-spectrum sunblock with an SPF of 30 or higher.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>Get Enough Sleep: Sleep is essential for skin health, as it gives your skin time to regenerate and heal. Aim for 7-9 hours of sleep per night for healthy and refreshed skin.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>Use a Face Mask: Use an organic face mask once a week to give your skin an extra boost of hydration and nourishment. Look for masks containing ingredients like honey, aloe vera, and avocado, which can help to hydrate and soothe your skin.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>Use a Facial Oil: Facial oils can help to hydrate and nourish your skin, leaving it looking healthy and radiant. Use a few drops of organic, cold-pressed oil, such as argan or rosehip oil, on your face before bed.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>Drink BeauTeas Organic skin care teas:)</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>Eat a Healthy and Balanced Diet: A healthy and balanced diet can have a big impact on the health of your skin. Focus on eating plenty of fruits, vegetables, and whole grains, and limit your intake of processed and sugary foods.</p>
</li>
</ol>', 2,
   (SELECT id FROM blog_categories WHERE slug='learn'), 'Top 10 Most Important Ways to Take Care of Your Skin', 'Having healthy and radiant skin requires proper care and attention. However, with so many products and routines on the market, it can be overwhelming to know where to start. In this article, we will focus on the top 10 most important ways to take care of your skin with a focus on hydration and organ',
   CAST(strftime('%s', '2023-01-29') AS INTEGER), unixepoch(), unixepoch(), 'shopify-migration');

