VALUES ('9 Tips to Fight Acne and Make Your Skin Glow!', '9-tips-to-fight-acne-and-make-your-skin-glow', '2023-02-07', 'BeauTeas Team', 'Acne is a common skin condition that affects many people at some point in their lives. While it can be a frustrating and embarrassing issue, there are several simple and effective ways to reduce acne and improve the overall appearance of your skin. Here are the top 9 tips for reducing acne:', '[]', 'https://img.beauteas.com/blog/pexels-cottonbro-studio-4812636.jpg', '9 Tips to Fight Acne and Make Your Skin Glow!',
   'published', '<p>Acne is a common skin condition that affects many people at some point in their lives. While it can be a frustrating and embarrassing issue, there are several simple and effective ways to reduce acne and improve the overall appearance of your skin. Here are the top 9 tips for reducing acne:</p>
<ol>
<li>
<p>Keep your skin clean: Regularly wash your face twice a day with a gentle cleanser and warm water to remove dirt, oil, and bacteria that can contribute to acne breakouts.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>Hydrate: Drinking plenty of water and using a hydrating moisturizer can help to keep your skin hydrated and reduce the appearance of acne.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>Avoid picking and squeezing: Touching and squeezing pimples can spread bacteria and cause further breakouts. Instead, gently cleanse the affected area and leave it to heal on its own.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>Watch what you eat: Eating a diet high in processed foods, sugar, and dairy can trigger acne. Instead, focus on eating a balanced diet that includes plenty of fresh fruits and vegetables.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>Reduce stress: Stress can contribute to acne, so it''s important to find healthy ways to manage stress, such as exercise, yoga, or meditation.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>Avoid harsh skincare products: Harsh skincare products that contain alcohol, fragrances, or other irritants can make acne worse. Instead, look for products that are formulated for sensitive skin and are free of harmful chemicals.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>Use organic skincare products: Using organic skincare products can help to reduce the risk of skin irritation and provide gentle, nourishing care for your skin.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>Get plenty of sleep: Getting enough sleep is important for overall health, including skin health. Aim for 7-9 hours of sleep each night to help reduce the appearance of acne.</p>
</li>
<li>Of course we recommend drinking our Organic skin care teas! We have a full money back guarantee!</li>
</ol>', 1,
   (SELECT id FROM blog_categories WHERE slug='learn'), '9 Tips to Fight Acne and Make Your Skin Glow!', 'Acne is a common skin condition that affects many people at some point in their lives. While it can be a frustrating and embarrassing issue, there are several simple and effective ways to reduce acne and improve the overall appearance of your skin. Here are the top 9 tips for reducing acne: Keep you',
   CAST(strftime('%s', '2023-02-07') AS INTEGER), unixepoch(), unixepoch(), 'shopify-migration');

