<p data-mce-fragment="1">During winter, the combination of harsh, dry air and the thrill of snow sports can take a toll on your delicate skin. Low humidity levels draw moisture away, leaving your skin dry and your lips chapped. But fear not, for the solution to winter skin woes is as comforting as a warm embrace: a cup of Beauteas'' organic skincare tea.</p>
<p data-mce-fragment="1"><strong data-mce-fragment="1">A Sip of Soothing Salvation</strong></p>
